IMPORT prelude

§ `Penal Code 1871 -- shared domain`

-- Ontology for the encoding of Penal Code 1871 (2020 Revised Edition,
-- current version as at 09 Sep 2026). Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.
-- This module owns the nouns. Rule modules import these types and never redeclare them.
-- INERT STYLE. No field name contains an apostrophe: 's is L4's projection operator.

§§ `Place of an act -- sections 2, 3, 4, 4A, 4B`

DECLARE Place IS ONE OF
    `wholly in Singapore`
    `wholly outside Singapore`
    `partly in Singapore`

§§ `Remote communication -- section 416B(2)`

DECLARE `Remote Channel` IS ONE OF
    `not remote`
    `the Internet`
    `telephone or other communication device`
    `television or radio`
    `other electronic or other technology for facilitating communication`

§§ `Actor -- sections 11, 21, 4, 4A, 82, 83, 84`

DECLARE Actor HAS
    `name` IS A STRING
    `age in years` IS A NUMBER
    `is a citizen or permanent resident of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is acting or purporting to act in the course of employment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has sufficient maturity of understanding` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is of unsound mind at the time of the act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is incapable of knowing the nature of the act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is incapable of knowing the act is wrong by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is incapable of knowing the act is wrong as contrary to law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is completely deprived of any power to control his actions` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Fault -- sections 23, 24, 25, 26, 26B, 26C, 26D`

DECLARE Fault HAS
    `intends to cause wrongful gain to self or another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to cause wrongful loss to another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended gain is of property to which the gainer is not legally entitled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended gain is the avoidance of a loss of property which the avoider is not legally entitled to avoid` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended gain is by unlawful means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended loss is of property to which the loser is legally entitled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended loss is an exposure to the risk of a loss` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended loss is by unlawful means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is dishonest by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor knows the act is dishonest by those standards` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to deceive another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that an advantage accrue or a detriment befall by means of the deception` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended advantage or detriment is so slight that no reasonable person would complain` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does the act deliberately` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has sufficient cause to believe the relevant circumstance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is aware that the relevant circumstance exists or is virtually certain to exist` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is wilfully blind to the relevant circumstance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done or believed without due care and attention` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intended to cause the effect by the means employed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knew or had reason to believe the means employed were likely to cause the effect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows there is a real risk that the relevant circumstance exists or will exist` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows there is a real risk that the effect will be caused` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it would have been unreasonable to have taken that risk` IS A BOOLEAN
    `omits to do an act which a reasonable person would do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does an act which a reasonable person would not do` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Deception -- sections 415, 416, 416B, 417, 418, 419, 420`

DECLARE Deception HAS
    `deceives a person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `deception was the sole or main inducement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a dishonest concealment of facts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a mere breach of contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the deceived is a company association or body of persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an individual officer employee or agent of the deceived was personally deceived` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces consent that any person retain property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally induces an act or omission the deceived would not otherwise do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to mind` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to reputation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pretends to be some other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly substitutes one person for another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `represents that a person is a person other than that person really is` IS A BOOLEAN
    `remote channel` IS A `Remote Channel`
    `the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows the cheating is likely to cause wrongful loss to a person whose interest the actor was bound to protect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of anything signed or sealed and capable of being converted into a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Personal information -- section 416A`

DECLARE `Personal Information Dealing` HAS
    `the information is personal information about an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `obtains or retains the personal information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `supplies offers transmits or makes available the personal information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `purpose is use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe it will be or is likely to be used to commit or facilitate an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `merely provides or operates network access or routing facilities` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Services -- section 420A`

DECLARE `Services Obtained` HAS
    `obtains services for self or another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the services are made available on the basis that payment has been is being or will be made` IS A BOOLEAN
    `obtains the services without payment or without payment in full` IS A BOOLEAN
    `when obtaining knows they are or might be made available on that payment basis` IS A BOOLEAN
    `when obtaining intends that payment will not be made or will not be made in full` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Fraud by representation -- sections 424A and 424B`

DECLARE `Fraud Conduct` HAS
    `makes a false representation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fails to disclose information which the actor is under a legal duty to disclose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `abuses a position expected to safeguard the financial interests of another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the representation is untrue or misleading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor knows it is or might be untrue or misleading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the representation is submitted to a system or device designed to receive communications` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the acts were material` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Property taking -- sections 378 and 403`

DECLARE `Property Taking` HAS
    `the property is movable` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to take the property out of the possession of any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `moves the property in order to such taking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly misappropriates or converts movable property to own use` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Trust -- section 405`

DECLARE Trust HAS
    `is entrusted with property or with any dominion over property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly misappropriates or converts that property to own use` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly uses or disposes of that property in violation of a direction of law or legal contract touching the trust` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally suffers any other person to do so` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Document making -- sections 463 and 464`

DECLARE `Document Making` HAS
    `makes a document or electronic record or part of one` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes signs seals executes or affixes an electronic signature` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends it to be believed that it was made signed sealed executed or affixed by or by the authority of a person by whom the actor knows it was not` IS A BOOLEAN
    `without lawful authority alters a document or electronic record in any material part` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes a person who does not know the contents to sign seal execute or alter` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause damage or injury to the public or to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to support any claim or title` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause any person to part with property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause any person to enter into any express or implied contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to commit fraud or that fraud may be committed` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Speech -- sections 499, 503, 504, 505`

DECLARE Speech HAS
    `makes or publishes an imputation concerning any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by words spoken or intended to be read or by signs or visible representations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to harm or knows or has reason to believe the imputation will harm that person reputation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the imputation would lower that person moral or intellectual character in the estimation of others` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the imputation would lower that person character in respect of his calling in the estimation of others` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the imputation would lower that person credit in the estimation of others` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the imputation would cause it to be believed that the body of that person is in a loathsome or generally disgraceful state` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a section 499 exception applies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `threatens another with injury to person reputation or property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `or to the person or reputation of anyone in whom that person is interested` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause alarm` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause that person to do an act the person is not legally bound to do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause that person to omit an act the person is legally entitled to do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intent is that the act or omission be the means of avoiding the execution of the threat` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the threat is to cause death or grievous hurt or destruction of property by fire` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally insults and thereby gives provocation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intending or knowing it likely the provocation will cause a breach of the public peace or any other offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes publishes or circulates a statement rumour or report` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in written electronic or other media` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent or likely to cause an officer or serviceman of the Singapore Armed Forces a visiting force or a section 140B person to mutiny or to disregard or fail in his duty` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent or likely to cause fear or alarm to the public whereby a person may be induced to commit an offence against the State or public tranquillity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent or likely to incite any class or community to commit an offence against any other class or community` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has reasonable grounds for believing the statement is true and without the intents above` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Abetment -- sections 107, 108, 108A, 108B`

DECLARE Abetment HAS
    `instigates any person to do the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `engages with one or more other persons in a conspiracy for the doing of the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an act or illegal omission takes place in pursuance of that conspiracy and in order to the doing of that thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally aids by any act or illegal omission the doing of the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing would be an offence if committed by a person capable of committing an offence with the same intention or knowledge as the abettor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the abetment takes place in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act abetted would be committed outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act abetted would constitute an offence if committed in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence abetted would be committed in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `any or all of the acts constituting the abetment were done outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `facts unknown to the abettor make the doing of the thing impossible` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Conspiracy -- section 120A`

DECLARE Conspiracy HAS
    `the person` IS A STRING
    `the other person` IS A STRING
    `there is an agreement to commit or cause an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the subject offence would be an offence if committed in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `location of the subject offence` IS A Place
    `the other person intends to carry out the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `facts unknown to the person make commission impossible` IS A BOOLEAN
    `any acts of the conspiracy were done in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Attempt -- section 511`

DECLARE Attempt HAS
    `intends to commit an offence punishable by this Code or any other written law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `takes a substantial step towards the commission of that offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is strongly corroborative of an intention to commit the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `facts unknown to the actor make the doing of the thing impossible` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `General exceptions -- Chapter 4, sections 76 to 95`

DECLARE `Exception Facts` HAS
    `bound by law to do it or justified by law in doing it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a judge acting judicially in the exercise of a power given or believed in good faith to be given by law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done in pursuance of or warranted by the judgment or order of a court of justice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the judgment or order remains in force` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the doer in good faith believes the court had jurisdiction to pass it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of a mistake of fact or ignorance of a fact believes in good faith he is bound or justified by law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `another written law otherwise provides` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done by accident or misfortune` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the doing of a lawful act in a lawful manner by lawful means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done with proper care and caution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done only with knowledge that it is likely to cause harm` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done in good faith to prevent or avoid other harm to person or property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the harm to be prevented was of such a nature and so imminent as to justify the risk` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intoxication caused without the knowledge or against the will of the person charged` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of intoxication did not know what he was doing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of intoxication did not know the act was wrong by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of intoxication did not know the act was wrong as contrary to law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of intoxication was of unsound mind as determined under section 84` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is intended to cause death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is known by the doer to be likely to cause death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is intended to cause grievous hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is known by the doer to be likely to cause grievous hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an attempt to cause death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the voluntary causing of grievous hurt or an attempt to cause grievous hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the voluntary causing of hurt or an attempt to cause hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the purpose is preventing death or grievous hurt or curing a grievous disease or infirmity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the purpose is preventing death or hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the abetment of an offence to which the exception would not extend` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person harmed is above 18 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person harmed has consented expressly or impliedly to suffer that harm or to take the risk of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is done in good faith for the benefit of the person harmed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the benefit relied on is merely pecuniary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person harmed is below 12 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person harmed is of unsound mind` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the guardian or person having lawful charge has consented expressly or impliedly` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is done by the guardian or other person having lawful charge` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is impossible for the person harmed to signify consent or he is incapable of giving it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `there is no guardian or person in lawful charge from whom consent can be obtained in time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is an offence independently of any harm to the person consenting` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the consent was given under fear of injury or wrongful restraint to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the consent was given under a misconception of fact` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the doer knows or has reason to believe the consent was given in consequence of that fear or misconception` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the consent giver was unable to understand the nature and consequence of it through unsoundness of mind mental incapacity intoxication or drugs` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the consent giver is below 12 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a contrary intention as to the age of consent appears from the context` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a communication made in good faith for the benefit of the person to whom it is made` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is compelled by threats reasonably causing apprehension of instant death to that person or another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the doer placed himself in that situation of his own accord or from apprehension of harm short of instant death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence is murder or an offence against the State punishable with death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `harm is so slight that no person of ordinary sense and temper would complain` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Proposed Act -- the agent-facing bundle`

DECLARE `Proposed Act` HAS
    `actor` IS AN Actor
    `place of the act` IS A Place
    `place of any other relevant act` IS A Place
    `intends to make a gain or cause a loss or harm` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to cause exposure to a risk of loss` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that gain loss or harm occurs in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `exception facts` IS AN `Exception Facts`
    `fault` IS A Fault
    `deception` IS A Deception
    `personal information dealing` IS A `Personal Information Dealing`
    `services obtained` IS A `Services Obtained`
    `fraud conduct` IS A `Fraud Conduct`
    `property taking` IS A `Property Taking`
    `trust` IS A Trust
    `document making` IS A `Document Making`
    `speech` IS A Speech
    `abetment` IS AN Abetment
    `conspiracy` IS A Conspiracy
    `attempt` IS AN Attempt

